    "claims": [
      "Periodic workflows for recurring jobs and weekly reports",
      "Alerts for customers over credit limit or items below minimum stock",
      "Structured item and customer creation workflows",
      "Approval for sales quotes and release of sales orders",
      "Enforces mandatory fields such as description, posting groups and prices",
      "Four-eyes principle on releases",
      "Automatic actions such as printing order confirmations or creating production orders",
      "Ad hoc workflows to share information with a colleague",
      "Assisted setup with email setup and workflow templates",
      "Templates for delayed or unconfirmed purchase orders",
      "Templates checking zero prices on sales orders and blanket orders",
      "Templates for erroneous journal lines and new EDI sales orders",
      "Multi-level releases with release groups",
      "Every workflow step is documented for audits",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
    ],
